---
source: crates/qrec-core/src/view/palette.rs
expression: text(&view)
---
## Recent
Save frame as PNG                            [P]              qrec frame save
Split clip                                   [S]              qrec clip split
Export…                                      [Ctrl][E]        qrec export
## Record
Toggle record                                [R]              qrec record toggle
Record over selection                        [O]              qrec record start --over
Discard last take                            [D]              qrec take discard-last
Cancel recording                             [Esc]            qrec record cancel
## Playback
Play / pause                                 [Space]          qrec play
Shuttle reverse                              [J]              —
Shuttle stop                                 [K]              —
Shuttle forward                              [L]              —
Seek to previous frame                       [←]              qrec seek --by -1f
Seek to next frame                           [→]              qrec seek --by +1f
Seek back 1 s                                [Shift][←]       qrec seek --by -1s
Seek forward 1 s                             [Shift][→]       qrec seek --by +1s
Seek to previous edit point                  [↑]              qrec seek --edit prev
Seek to next edit point                      [↓]              qrec seek --edit next
Seek to timeline start                       [Home]           qrec seek --to start
Seek to timeline end                         [End]            qrec seek --to end
## Edit
Select previous clip                         [,]              —
Select next clip                             [.]              —
Move selection left                          [<]              qrec clip move --by -1
Move selection right                         [>]              qrec clip move --by 1
Split clip                                   [S]              qrec clip split
Trim start to playhead                       [[]              qrec clip trim --start
Trim end to playhead                         []]              qrec clip trim --end
Nudge start edge 1 frame                     [Alt][[]         qrec clip trim --start +1f
Nudge end edge 1 frame                       [Alt][]]         qrec clip trim --end -1f
Nudge start edge 10 frames                   [Alt][{]         qrec clip trim --start +10f
Nudge end edge 10 frames                     [Alt][}]         qrec clip trim --end -10f
Remove clips                                 [Del] [X] [Backspace] qrec clip remove
Autocut                                      [C]              qrec autocut
Autocut settings and preview                 [Shift][C]       qrec autocut --dry-run
Undo                                         [Ctrl][Z]        qrec undo
Redo                                         [Ctrl][Shift][Z] [Ctrl][Y] qrec redo  (off: Nothing to redo)
Clear undo history                                            qrec history clear --yes
Select all                                   [Ctrl][A]        —
## Output
Save frame as PNG                            [P]              qrec frame save
Export…                                      [Ctrl][E]        qrec export
## View
Zoom timeline in                             [=]              —
Zoom timeline out                            [−]              —
Zoom to fit                                  [\]              —
Zoom to selection                            [Z]              —
Toggle snapping                              [N]              —
Switch Live / Program                        [Tab]            —
Toggle bin                                   [B]              qrec take list --unused
Keyboard shortcuts                           [?]              qrec keys
Command palette                              [Ctrl][K] [:]    —
Settings                                     [Ctrl][,]        qrec config
Focus next region                            [F6]             —
Focus previous region                        [Shift][F6]      —
Quit                                         [Ctrl][Q]        —
## Canvas
Nudge layer left 1 px                        [←]              qrec scene layer set --rect  (off: Select a layer on the canvas)
Nudge layer right 1 px                       [→]              qrec scene layer set --rect  (off: Select a layer on the canvas)
Nudge layer up 1 px                          [↑]              qrec scene layer set --rect  (off: Select a layer on the canvas)
Nudge layer down 1 px                        [↓]              qrec scene layer set --rect  (off: Select a layer on the canvas)
Nudge layer left 10 px                       [Shift][←]       qrec scene layer set --rect  (off: Select a layer on the canvas)
Nudge layer right 10 px                      [Shift][→]       qrec scene layer set --rect  (off: Select a layer on the canvas)
Nudge layer up 10 px                         [Shift][↑]       qrec scene layer set --rect  (off: Select a layer on the canvas)
Nudge layer down 10 px                       [Shift][↓]       qrec scene layer set --rect  (off: Select a layer on the canvas)
